  "intervention_target": "objective",
  "rationale": "Diagnostics show distance_from_center increased strongly (mean 0.3789, std 0.0214) at the same time performance collapsed (mean 0.008636). Reducing the explicit weight on distance_from_center should reduce the conflicting exploration pressure and allow performance to drive selection again.",
